        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions RD-MT-1x2  Modern Door Stop</b>\r\n<p>\r\nVery clean looking modern floor mount door stop (door bumper) that is easy to install. Includes the mounting screw. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis door stop is mounted to the floor, allowing the bottom of the door to contact it. If using near a wall, you want to mount the stop in a position so that the rubber bumper contacts the door before the door knob touches the wall. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions RD-MT-1x2 Door Stop\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height:  2-1/2\" </li>\r\n<li>Height of Rubber from Floor: 2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Color: Black</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Includes Mounting Hardware</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n\r\n<br><br>\r\nOnly (2)  Polished Chrome and (3) Satin Nickel Left.\r\n</p>",
